{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blackwood: Beneath the Silence\u00a0</strong>is a single\u2011player, narrative and exploration\u2011driven psychological horror. As a newly assigned teacher, you search a shuttered school for a missing student\u2014through sealed classrooms, forgotten rituals, and something watching from the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense exploration where light and sound guide your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles: keys, fuses, chalk markings, locked doors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragmented storytelling via notes, tapes, and objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stalking entity that reacts to sight and sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player choices shaping multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror focused on exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles and light survival elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic stalker AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4\u20136 hours, single player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI/Subtitles: English and Turkish</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Warning</strong><br>Intense suspense, dark themes, jump scares, oppressive atmosphere.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983170?t=1758054333","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983170?t=1758054333","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983170/fa9976930c37e4e29d6c846d52189409c7615289/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758054333","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983170/fa9976930c37e4e29d6c846d52189409c7